&lt;li&gt;Measurable improvements in data quality, observability, and platform reliability (fewer/faster-resolved incidents via RCA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stronger, more automated DataOps/SDLC processes reducing manual overhead across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable data models that support the platform’s growth across Analytics, GenAI Engineering, and self-service users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closer technical alignment between Data Platforms, GenAI Engineering, and Analytics Engineering on shared solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
